[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 964.31, "timestamp": "00:16:04", "text": "。 何をすべきかとか色々考えすぎて、それに気を取られていたら午前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 976.31, "timestamp": "00:16:16", "text": "5時、6時になって、眠れなかったんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 986.47, "timestamp": "00:16:26", "text": "昨日は、心の中が空っぽで、混乱していて、色々な感情が入り混じっていました。  「ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 992.71, "timestamp": "00:16:32", "text": "日曜日に配信する予定なのに、そういう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 997.55, "timestamp": "00:16:37", "text": "気分になれない」って思ったんです。 だから、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 999.31, "timestamp": "00:16:39", "text": "ぐっすり眠れた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1003.59, "timestamp": "00:16:43", "text": "えっと、午前1時頃まで、午後1時頃まで。 たぶん"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1006.23, "timestamp": "00:16:46", "text": "12歳の時だったと思う。目が覚めたら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1008.389, "timestamp": "00:16:48", "text": "「ああ、まずい。YouTubeの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1011.35, "timestamp": "00:16:51", "text": "配信を止めなきゃ」って思ったんだ。 つまり、私はそれを終了したわけではなく、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1012.486, "timestamp": "00:16:52", "author": "@irumaVT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9ybSHxr-ali9lBPfsyuUVuKpIevGpkL17bcUltOiPnYPm0EeyQBNGQpGBfpZmwWdz7QqUrf6=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ8_8KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1014.327, "timestamp": "00:16:54", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Iruma Vitale VT~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1016.629, "timestamp": "00:16:56", "text": "Beamからのマルチストリームを停止したということです。 ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1019.43, "timestamp": "00:16:59", "text": "Beamアプリがありますよ。 ちなみに、Beamという"}]